# The devnet miner's Windows files must stay CRLF, byte for byte, in git and in the zip.
# "-text" means git never converts line endings for these files, on any machine or git setting
# (an eol=crlf rule would store them as LF, and the zip is packed straight from git).
# tests/site_publish_checks.py and scripts/build_zips.py both refuse a bare LF in them.
*.bat -text
miner/devnet/*.txt -text
